Name: from 0.1.58 this fork is called Aleph (it was called Reading Board).
In 0.1.58 only the name shown to the reader changed. From 0.1.60 the
plugin's folder, module names, settings, cache and gesture actions are renamed
too (readingboard.koplugin → aleph.koplugin, readingboard_*.lua →
aleph_*.lua); aleph_migrate.lua carries settings, library index, cache,
gestures and pins over from the old names. Notices in this folder that say
Reading Board refer to the same fork.
